    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hikidama is a platform where you control a ball, using an anchor that pulls it in the direction you want it to go. Collect gems and resources while you get used to this peculiar mechanic, and with these resources, upgrade your ball to make it easier to control, or perhaps more visually appealing with a generous list of skins and cosmetics. Above all, revive this sport that has been dead for 50 years, while discovering the reasons that led to its cancellation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hikidama is a platform where you control a ball, using an anchor that pulls it in the direction you want it to go. Collect gems and resources while you get used to this peculiar mechanic, and with these resources, upgrade your ball to make it easier to control, or perhaps more visually appealing with a generous list of skins and cosmetics. Above all, revive this sport that has been dead for 50 years, while discovering the reasons that led to its cancellation.</p>",
    "short_description": "Platform through a variety of scenarios, or compete in races using the best vehicle man could invent, a metal ball.",
